Implementasikan replay key sama/payload sama, conflict key sama/payload berbeda, serta reuse transaction-safe setelah expiry 24 jam.

Tambahkan repository integration test untuk success multi-item, Product inactive, Contact soft-deleted/cross-company, duplicate Product, rollback, same-key concurrency, different-key same-PIC concurrency, replay, payload conflict, dan expired-key reuse.

Jalankan disposable migration fresh-up, down, up kembali; assert legacy columns hilang pada up dan kembali nullable pada down.



